      `C was residing in Ukraine immediately before 1 January 2022` IS A BOOLEAN
      `C left Ukraine in connection with the Russian invasion which took place on 24 February 2022` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 23A(1)(f): the Ukraine paragraph applies` MEANS
