    AND `C left Sudan in connection with the violence which rapidly escalated on 15 April 2023 in Khartoum and across Sudan`

-- reg 23A(1)(h): ... where C (i) was residing in Israel, the West Bank, the Gaza Strip, East Jerusalem, the Golan Heights or
