    AND `condition B is met`
    AND `condition C is met`
    AND `condition D is met`

-- reg 23A(1)(j): as part of a safe and legal humanitarian immigration route, leave to enter or remain in the United Kingdom
-- in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of the Immigration Act 1971 or leave on a discretionary
-- basis outside of rules.
