      `the leave is leave on a discretionary basis outside of rules` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 23A(1)(j): C has leave as part of a safe and legal humanitarian immigration route` MEANS
        `C has leave as part of a safe and legal humanitarian immigration route`
    AND (   `the leave is to enter or remain in the United Kingdom in accordance with immigration rules made under section 3(2) of the Immigration Act 1971`
         OR `the leave is leave on a discretionary basis outside of rules`)

